     1254x1254) and translated so it occupies only the inner ~50% of the
     canvas, centered - well inside the adaptive-icon-style "safe zone" (inner
     ~66%) that the splash icon container crops/masks to. A first attempt at
     ~62% still had the horns clipped at the top, so this pass uses a more
     generous margin instead of chasing the exact safe-zone boundary. -->
